          "login": "dtolnay"
        },
        "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
        "body": "This is a breaking change for rq which overrides write_string_fragment: [rq/value/json.rs](https://github.com/dflemstr/rq/blob/v0.9.2/src/value/json.rs)\r\n\r\nPlease do not make any changes to Formatter in this PR. The loop for calling write_string_fragment / write_char_escape should live outside of Formatter.\r\n\r\nI filed #268 to follow up on the argument type in the next major release.",
